infographic sequence-pyramid-simple
data
  title The test pyramid hexagonal teams actually run
  desc Port ownership makes domain tests cheap, so the pyramid inverts naturally — full CI ~45s
  sequences
    - label E2E tests — 5 (seconds–minutes)
      desc Full app, all real adapters wired; verify integration wiring. Keep to critical happy paths only.
    - label Adapter tests — 30 (seconds)
      desc Each adapter vs its port contract on a real DB/API; verifies the domain-object ↔ row mapping.
    - label Domain tests — 400 (milliseconds)
      desc Drive the primary port with in-memory fakes; every business rule, zero infrastructure.
theme
  palette #f43f5e #f59e0b #14b8a6
